---
---
<section class="section-alt" id="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal" style="max-width:720px">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Concern</p>
      <h2 class="h-lg">Hair fall isn&rsquo;t always just &ldquo;hair fall.&rdquo;</h2>
      <div class="divider" style="margin-top:28px"></div>
      <p class="lead">
        Persistent shedding can gradually lead to visibly thinner hair, reduced
        density, and growing concern about long-term hair loss. Understanding what
        you&rsquo;re dealing with is the first step towards a routine that fits it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 3c0 5-5 6-5 11a5 5 0 0 0 10 0c0-5-5-6-5-11z" />
            <path d="M12 21v-5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Hair Fall</h3>
        <p>For people noticing increased shedding.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M4 7h16" /><path d="M6 12h12" /><path d="M9 17h6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Thinning</h3>
        <p>For hair that is gradually losing density and fullness.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="7" cy="6" r="2.4" /><circle cx="17" cy="6" r="2.4" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="18" r="2.4" />
            <path d="M7 8.4V11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1" />
            <path d="M17 8.4V11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1" />
            <path d="M12 13v2.6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Genetic Hair Loss</h3>
        <p>For people experiencing a hereditary pattern of hair thinning.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
